OL,3,GNEWSAJacket from Freddie Mercury's swan
OL,4,Asong to be sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jacket worn by rock legend Freddie
OL,7,FMercury during his last live
OL,8,Fperformance is looking for Somebody to
OL,9,FLove as it goes up for auction this
OL,10,Fweek.
OL,12,FBidders will be Under Pressure for the
OL,13,Fcropped leather jacket the Queen star
OL,14,Fwore during a surprise guest appearance
OL,15,Falongside Cliff Richard at a charity
OL,16,Fgala at the Dominion Theatre, in
OL,17,FLondon, in April 1988.
OL,19,FAuctioneers Henry Aldridge & Son, based
OL,20,Fin Devizes, Wiltshire, expect the
OL,21,Fjacket to fetch up to #150,000 when it
OL,22,Fis put under the hammer on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
