OL,3,GNEWSAJacket from Freddie Mercury's swan
OL,4,Asong to be sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuctioneer Andrew Aldridge said the
OL,7,Fjacket is part of a group of items
OL,8,Fwhich are an "extremely important part
OL,9,Fin the history of Freddie Mercury".
